+ 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至76% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","피의 마법진이 초당 입히는 대미지가 76% + 8% ATK로 증가한다. 마법진 종료 시 입히는 고정 대미지가 380% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至80% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","피의 마법진이 초당 입히는 대미지가 80% + 8% ATK로 증가한다. 마법진 종료 시 입히는 고정 대미지가 400% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter"